# StarCraft's data files are copyrighted and must never be committed, wherever they are put
*.mpq
*.MPQ
# (except BWAPI's own network plugin file)
!3rdparty/openbw/bwapi/bwapi/SNP_DirectIP/SNP/caps.mpq

# Bots dropped into bots/ come from elsewhere, with their own licences, so they stay out of git; tracked are the
# framework, the example, and the recipe bots whose licences allow sharing them (patched, without their DLLs).
# SAIDA and WillyT state no licence and Dragon is 37 MB, so they stay recipes: tools/fetch_bot.py SAIDA WillyT Dragon
bots/*
!bots/README.md
!bots/StardustBots.cmake
!bots/WorkerRush/
!bots/recipes/
!bots/ClaudeOpus55/
!bots/ClaudeOpus55RL/
bots/ClaudeOpus55RL/training/pending.json
!bots/genai/
!bots/compat/
!bots/ComputerAI/
!bots/BananaBrain/
!bots/McRaveZ/
!bots/Microwave/
!bots/Steamhammer2025/
!bots/Stardust2025/
bots/*/**/*.dll
# Stardust's mining-training folder is a copy of its author's whole dev environment, only needed to retrain
bots/Stardust2025/mining-training/

# Personal Claude Code settings
.claude/settings.local.json
